  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5751e45b3bc551448917ed569792a2a2, type: 3}
  m_Name: Message from a scientist to the chief scientist
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  fullText: Premou, we have made a mistake. I stayed after hours to finish an analysis
    of ???, and I believe the unknown signals we recorded started when we brought
    it down here. It seems to react to water, and is instructed to activate as it
    touches it. Furthermore, while we have not figured out what data ??? holds, we
    have repeatedly caught something coming out of it, as if it was emitting some
    sort of wave. I have reasons to believe this was never meant for us.  It is not
    a message, it is a beacon. And it is leading someone here.
  currentText: 
  placeFoundText: 
  timeFound: 
  orderToDisplay: 75
